{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>For</b> — the meaning of <i>zeal for Your house</i>: that the enemies were reviling the house where the Ark was. And the probable interpretation: this psalm was spoken through the Holy Spirit concerning the time of the exile, and the proof: <i>and the cities of Judah shall be built</i> [Isaiah 44:28]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 69, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra's second proof citation is not from the psalm itself; I have resolved the elliptical ויבנה ערי יהודה to Isaiah 44:28 by inference."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:24.447013306Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}